  "description": {
   "en": "A collection of short stories originally published between 1985 and 1991.\n\n- Kikai (Space Oddity) [1985]\n- Kaiyousei (The Planet of Depths) [1988]\n- Hito (Fly) [1989]\n- Dai Machine (The Great Machine) [1989]\n- Uchuu Kaizoku Shounendan (Junks: The Space Rovers) [1990]\n- Mirai Tokyo Headman (Future Tokyo Headman) [1991]\n\nThe stories were later included in Kodansha's reissued volumes of Gunnm: Last Order, where volumes 1 through 7 each contained one story."
  },
